# Line endings.
#
# The repository is public and will be cloned on Windows, macOS and Linux. Without
# this, each platform's core.autocrlf decides for itself and the same file comes
# back as a whole-file diff on someone else's machine.
#
# text=auto lets Git detect which files are text; eol=lf pins those to LF both in
# the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets Git must never inspect or normalise.
*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated: collapse it in diffs and mark it so GitHub's language stats ignore it.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
